   "doc": "{\"schema\": \"acoustilab-netlist/0.1\", \"title\": \"Open-back cup radiating through a rear grille (theory-only example)\", \"description\": \"The same 40 mm driver (Tymphany HPD-40N16PET00-32 primary set, docs/spec-errata.md E5) in an open-back cup. Behind the driver a 5 cm3 space opens through a grille of 50 holes, 1.5 mm in diameter in a 1 mm plate, into the air outside the cup; the grille's outer face radiates as a 20 mm radius opening without a baffle. The free-radiation model is the low-frequency unflanged approximation, so the result flags it above ka = 0.5 (about 1.4 kHz). The front cavity is a two-node depth line closed by a leakier pad than the closed-back example: a 0.15 mm slit whose Poiseuille RC corner with the front cavity is near 50 Hz. The bass barely drops below it, because this compliant diaphragm is force-driven: the front pressure is set by Sd*p = Bl*i until the leak impedance falls below the suspension stiffness reflected through Sd. u_rear_rad is the volume velocity that leaves the grille: multiplied by rho*f/(2r), it gives the monopole bleed estimate of spec Appendix C9 at distance r. Geometry is illustrative; there is no ear model.\", \"air\": {\"preset\": \"standard_23C\"}, \"sweep\": {\"f_min_Hz\": 10, \"f_max_Hz\": 20000, \"points_per_octave\": 24}, \"level\": 1, \"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"e_in\", \"domain\": \"electrical\"}, {\"id\": \"e_coil\", \"domain\": \"electrical\"}, {\"id\": \"m_dia\", \"domain\": \"mechanical\"}, {\"id\": \"a_front\", \"domain\": \"acoustic\"}, {\"id\": \"a_ear\", \"domain\": \"acoustic\"}, {\"id\": \"a_rear\", \"domain\": \"acoustic\"}, {\"id\": \"a_grille\", \"domain\": \"acoustic\"}], \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"amp\", \"type\": \"vsource\", \"node\": \"e_in\", \"V_V\": 1.0}, {\"id\": \"coil\", \"type\": \"coil\", \"nodes\": [\"e_in\", \"e_coil\"], \"Re_ohm\": 32.8}, {\"id\": \"motor\", \"type\": \"motor\", \"nodes\": [\"e_coil\", \"gnd\", \"m_dia\", \"gnd\"], \"Bl_Tm\": 2.24}, {\"id\": \"susp\", \"type\": \"suspension\", \"node\": \"m_dia\", \"Mms_g\": 0.3, \"Cms_mm_per_N\": 12.6, \"Rms_Ns_per_m\": 0.057}, {\"id\": \"dia\", \"type\": \"piston\", \"nodes\": [\"m_dia\", \"gnd\", \"a_front\", \"a_rear\"], \"Sd_cm2\": 10}, {\"id\": \"front\", \"type\": \"cavity\", \"nodes\": [\"a_front\", \"a_ear\"], \"radius_mm\": 25, \"depth_mm\": 15}, {\"id\": \"pad_leak\", \"type\": \"slit\", \"nodes\": [\"a_ear\", \"ambient\"], \"gap_mm\": 0.15, \"width_mm\": 40, \"length_mm\": 10}, {\"id\": \"rear_space\", \"type\": \"cavity\", \"node\": \"a_rear\", \"volume_cm3\": 5}, {\"id\": \"grille\", \"type\": \"tube\", \"nodes\": [\"a_rear\", \"a_grille\"], \"diameter_mm\": 1.5, \"length_mm\": 1, \"count\": 50, \"inlet\": \"flanged\"}, {\"id\": \"rear_rad\", \"type\": \"radiation\", \"node\": \"a_grille\", \"radius_mm\": 20, \"baffle\": \"free\"}], \"probes\": [{\"id\": \"p_ear\", \"quantity\": \"pressure\", \"node\": \"a_ear\"}, {\"id\": \"p_rear\", \"quantity\": \"pressure\", \"node\": \"a_rear\"}, {\"id\": \"zin\", \"quantity\": \"impedance\", \"element\": \"amp\"}, {\"id\": \"x\", \"quantity\": \"displacement\", \"node\": \"m_dia\"}, {\"id\": \"u_rear_rad\", \"quantity\": \"volume_velocity\", \"element\": \"rear_rad\"}, {\"id\": \"u_leak\", \"quantity\": \"volume_velocity\", \"element\": \"pad_leak\"}]}",
   "netlist": true,
